comando: buscar -type f \( -name '*.yaml' -o -name '*.yml' \) | while IFS= read -r f; do if grep -qE 'kind:[[:space:]]*(GitRepository|Kustomization|HelmRelease|HelmRepository|OCIRepository|ImagePolicy|ImageRepository)' "$f" 2>/dev/null; then echo "### $f"; grep -E '^(apiVersion:|kind:|  name:|  namespace:|  url:|    branch:|  path:|  interval:|  prune:)' "$f"; fi; done
